{"id":"2026-10-26-apps-creator-takes-down-popular","date":"2026-10-26","topic":"apps","region":"asia","headline":"Creator Takes Down Popular Flappy Bird Phone Game","source":{"name":"Wikipedia","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Flappy_Bird"},"accent":"us","tiers":{"t1":{"sentences":[{"text":"Dong Nguyen created a simple game in 2013.","voice":"voice/2026-10-26-apps-creator-takes-down-popular/t1-0.m4a","roles":["S","S","V","O","O","O","M","M"],"dur":4.13,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-26-apps-creator-takes-down-popular/ja/t1-0.m4a","durJa":4.68,"times":[0.0,0.34,0.72,1.42,1.76,2.06,2.54,2.88]},{"text":"The game became very popular in early 2014.","voice":"voice/2026-10-26-apps-creator-takes-down-popular/t1-1.m4a","roles":["S","S","V","C","C","M","M","M"],"dur":3.62,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-26-apps-creator-takes-down-popular/ja/t1-1.m4a","durJa":4.4,"times":[0.0,0.08,0.28,0.58,1.04,1.7,2.08,2.36]},{"text":"Dong Nguyen earned $50,000 every day from it.","voice":"voice/2026-10-26-apps-creator-takes-down-popular/t1-2.m4a","roles":["S","S","V","O","M","M","M","M"],"dur":4.21,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-26-apps-creator-takes-down-popular/ja/t1-2.m4a","durJa":4.21,"times":[0.0,0.2,0.5,1.37,2.36,3.28,3.56,3.86]},{"text":"He deleted the game in February 2014.","voice":"voice/2026-10-26-apps-creator-takes-down-popular/t1-3.m4a","roles":["S","V","O","O","M","M","M"],"dur":2.92,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-26-apps-creator-takes-down-popular/ja/t1-3.m4a","durJa":4.19,"times":[0.0,0.1,0.32,0.66,0.9,1.18,1.54]},{"text":"He stopped because people played it too much.","voice":"voice/2026-10-26-apps-creator-takes-down-popular/t1-4.m4a","roles":["S","V","M","S","V","O","M","M"],"dur":3.17,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-26-apps-creator-takes-down-popular/ja/t1-4.m4a","durJa":3.46,"times":[0.0,0.06,0.34,0.98,1.26,1.68,1.82,2.1]}],"bands":{"core1000":91,"core1800":0,"ngsl":0,"tsl":3,"nawl":0,"beyond":6},"grammar":[{"i":1,"focus":"became very popular","title":"Linking Verb with Complement","note":"The verb 'became' connects the subject to an adjective phrase describing its state. 'Very popular' acts as a subject complement here."},{"i":4,"focus":"because people played","title":"Reason Conjunction 'Because'","note":"The word 'because' introduces a reason clause explaining why he stopped. It is followed by a subject and a verb."}]},"t2":{"sentences":[{"text":"A programmer from Vietnam created a simple game called Flappy Bird.","voice":"voice/2026-10-26-apps-creator-takes-down-popular/t2-0.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","S","V","O","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":4.92,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-26-apps-creator-takes-down-popular/ja/t2-0.m4a","durJa":6.15,"times":[0.0,0.32,0.72,1.18,1.56,2.2,2.54,2.82,3.24,3.62,4.1]},{"text":"Players tapped the screen to guide a bird through narrow pipes.","voice":"voice/2026-10-26-apps-creator-takes-down-popular/t2-1.m4a","roles":["S","V","O","O","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":4.16,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-26-apps-creator-takes-down-popular/ja/t2-1.m4a","durJa":5.15,"times":[0.0,0.56,0.86,1.18,1.46,1.8,2.02,2.18,2.44,2.74,3.06]},{"text":"The game became famous in early 2014, so many people played.","voice":"voice/2026-10-26-apps-creator-takes-down-popular/t2-2.m4a","roles":["S","S","V","C","M","M","M","M","S","S","V"],"dur":5.36,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-26-apps-creator-takes-down-popular/ja/t2-2.m4a","durJa":5.54,"times":[0.0,0.36,0.62,0.98,1.58,1.84,2.08,3.36,3.82,4.12,4.52]},{"text":"It made $50,000 each day, but the creator felt very guilty.","voice":"voice/2026-10-26-apps-creator-takes-down-popular/t2-3.m4a","roles":["S","V","O","M","M","M","S","S","V","C","C"],"dur":6.2,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-26-apps-creator-takes-down-popular/ja/t2-3.m4a","durJa":5.42,"times":[0.0,0.4,0.94,1.8,2.54,3.52,3.84,3.94,4.26,4.72,5.04]},{"text":"He deleted the game because people played it too much.","voice":"voice/2026-10-26-apps-creator-takes-down-popular/t2-4.m4a","roles":["S","V","O","O","M","S","V","O","M","M"],"dur":3.88,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-26-apps-creator-takes-down-popular/ja/t2-4.m4a","durJa":3.76,"times":[0.0,0.42,0.68,1.14,1.44,1.88,2.18,2.68,2.86,3.04]},{"text":"Game fans will remember this famous story for a long time.","voice":"voice/2026-10-26-apps-creator-takes-down-popular/t2-5.m4a","roles":["S","S","V","V","O","O","O","M","M","M","M"],"dur":4.4,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-26-apps-creator-takes-down-popular/ja/t2-5.m4a","durJa":4.5,"times":[0.0,0.5,0.8,1.14,1.44,1.78,2.16,2.68,3.0,3.14,3.46]}],"bands":{"core1000":80,"core1800":10,"ngsl":5,"tsl":3,"nawl":0,"beyond":2},"grammar":[{"i":1,"focus":"to guide a bird","title":"Infinitive of Purpose","note":"The infinitive phrase 'to guide...' shows the purpose of the action. It explains why the players tapped the screen."},{"i":3,"focus":"felt very guilty","title":"Sensory Linking Verb","note":"The verb 'felt' connects the subject to an adjective describing their internal state. Here, 'guilty' functions as a subject complement."}]},"t3":{"sentences":[{"text":"Dong Nguyen, who is a Vietnamese developer, created a simple phone game in 2013.","voice":"voice/2026-10-26-apps-creator-takes-down-popular/t3-0.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","V","C","C","C","V","O","O","O","O","M","M"],"dur":6.2,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-26-apps-creator-takes-down-popular/ja/t3-0.m4a","durJa":7.46,"times":[0.0,0.34,1.16,1.24,1.36,1.48,1.78,3.1,3.48,3.86,4.12,4.56,4.88,5.18]},{"text":"The app, which was called Flappy Bird, suddenly became globally popular in early 2014.","voice":"voice/2026-10-26-apps-creator-takes-down-popular/t3-1.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","V","V","C","C","M","V","C","C","M","M","M"],"dur":6.12,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-26-apps-creator-takes-down-popular/ja/t3-1.m4a","durJa":6.82,"times":[0.0,0.08,0.64,0.72,0.88,1.16,1.68,2.3,2.72,3.2,3.66,4.36,4.8,5.02]},{"text":"Players tap their screens to navigate a small bird past green obstacles in the game.","voice":"voice/2026-10-26-apps-creator-takes-down-popular/t3-2.m4a","roles":["S","V","O","O","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":5.03,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-26-apps-creator-takes-down-popular/ja/t3-2.m4a","durJa":6.72,"times":[0.0,0.28,0.58,0.86,1.24,1.56,1.82,2.18,2.5,2.9,3.28,3.68,4.18,4.58,4.66]},{"text":"The free application generated $50,000 per day from advertisements shown inside the game.","voice":"voice/2026-10-26-apps-creator-takes-down-popular/t3-3.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","V","O","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":6.12,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-26-apps-creator-takes-down-popular/ja/t3-3.m4a","durJa":7.24,"times":[0.0,0.04,0.24,0.76,1.82,2.66,3.32,3.7,4.02,4.6,5.06,5.5,5.78]},{"text":"However, Nguyen felt guilty because he believed that users were playing it too constantly.","voice":"voice/2026-10-26-apps-creator-takes-down-popular/t3-4.m4a","roles":["M","S","V","C","M","S","V","M","S","V","V","O","M","M"],"dur":5.2,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-26-apps-creator-takes-down-popular/ja/t3-4.m4a","durJa":6.5,"times":[0.0,0.6,0.8,1.14,1.64,2.24,2.42,2.72,2.96,3.18,3.52,3.82,4.0,4.3]},{"text":"He decided to remove Flappy Bird from digital app stores on February 10, 2014.","voice":"voice/2026-10-26-apps-creator-takes-down-popular/t3-5.m4a","roles":["S","V","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","M","M","M","M"],"dur":5.17,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-26-apps-creator-takes-down-popular/ja/t3-5.m4a","durJa":6.83,"times":[0.0,0.04,0.28,0.58,0.9,1.46,1.68,1.9,2.2,2.5,2.74,3.12,3.52,4.36]},{"text":"Since its removal, millions of gaming fans have discussed his unusual and surprising decision.","voice":"voice/2026-10-26-apps-creator-takes-down-popular/t3-6.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","S","S","S","S","V","V","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":5.96,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-26-apps-creator-takes-down-popular/ja/t3-6.m4a","durJa":7.97,"times":[0.0,0.16,0.32,1.16,1.46,1.92,2.04,2.46,2.66,2.98,3.3,4.0,4.24,4.76]}],"bands":{"core1000":77,"core1800":7,"ngsl":7,"tsl":2,"nawl":0,"beyond":7},"grammar":[{"i":0,"focus":"who is a Vietnamese developer","title":"Non-defining Relative Clause","note":"This clause adds extra information about Dong Nguyen set off by commas. 'Who' acts as the subject inside this relative clause."},{"i":4,"focus":"that users were playing","title":"Noun Clause Object","note":"The conjunction 'that' introduces a noun clause functioning as the object of 'believed'. It contains its own subject and verb phrase."}]},"t4":{"sentences":[{"text":"In May 2013, Vietnamese software developer Dong Nguyen launched a simple mobile game named Flappy Bird.","voice":"voice/2026-10-26-apps-creator-takes-down-popular/t4-0.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","S","S","S","S","S","V","O","O","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":7.79,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-26-apps-creator-takes-down-popular/ja/t4-0.m4a","durJa":9.87,"times":[0.0,0.22,0.4,1.7,2.18,2.7,3.34,3.76,4.12,5.0,5.22,5.56,5.84,6.32,6.86,7.24]},{"text":"The mobile application experienced an unexpected surge in downloads, reaching top charts in early 2014.","voice":"voice/2026-10-26-apps-creator-takes-down-popular/t4-1.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","V","O","O","O","O","O","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":7.19,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-26-apps-creator-takes-down-popular/ja/t4-1.m4a","durJa":7.56,"times":[0.0,0.08,0.22,0.86,1.64,2.04,2.56,3.18,3.5,4.38,4.8,5.08,5.38,5.82,6.02]},{"text":"Players controlled a pixelated bird, maneuvering the character through small gaps between vertical green pipes.","voice":"voice/2026-10-26-apps-creator-takes-down-popular/t4-2.m4a","roles":["S","V","O","O","O","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":6.67,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-26-apps-creator-takes-down-popular/ja/t4-2.m4a","durJa":8.2,"times":[0.0,0.26,0.62,0.98,1.62,2.56,3.1,3.2,3.42,3.92,4.16,4.62,5.14,5.5,5.9]},{"text":"The free game generated approximately $50,000 in daily revenue from advertisements displayed within the application.","voice":"voice/2026-10-26-apps-creator-takes-down-popular/t4-3.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","V","O","O","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":7.31,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-26-apps-creator-takes-down-popular/ja/t4-3.m4a","durJa":6.76,"times":[0.0,0.08,0.3,0.56,1.14,2.32,3.0,3.58,3.82,4.24,4.66,5.26,5.96,6.34,6.54]},{"text":"Despite this major financial success, Nguyen stated that he felt guilty about the game's addictive nature.","voice":"voice/2026-10-26-apps-creator-takes-down-popular/t4-4.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","M","M","S","V","M","S","V","C","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":6.01,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-26-apps-creator-takes-down-popular/ja/t4-4.m4a","durJa":7.4,"times":[0.0,0.24,0.54,0.82,1.22,2.68,2.68,3.1,3.32,3.48,3.7,4.02,4.56,4.72,5.06,5.44]},{"text":"Consequently, the creator announced his decision to remove the product from all major mobile marketplaces.","voice":"voice/2026-10-26-apps-creator-takes-down-popular/t4-5.m4a","roles":["M","S","S","V","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":6.07,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-26-apps-creator-takes-down-popular/ja/t4-5.m4a","durJa":6.89,"times":[0.0,0.98,1.1,1.32,1.84,2.12,2.44,2.76,3.04,3.36,3.6,4.0,4.28,4.66,4.98]},{"text":"On February 10, 2014, Flappy Bird was officially withdrawn from both Apple's App Store and Google Play.","voice":"voice/2026-10-26-apps-creator-takes-down-popular/t4-6.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","M","S","S","V","V","V","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":6.96,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-26-apps-creator-takes-down-popular/ja/t4-6.m4a","durJa":8.12,"times":[0.0,0.08,0.3,1.12,2.3,2.68,2.94,3.14,3.7,4.12,4.64,4.8,5.3,5.48,5.74,6.2,6.44]},{"text":"Afterwards, smartphones with the installed game were listed online for thousands of dollars by opportunistic sellers.","voice":"voice/2026-10-26-apps-creator-takes-down-popular/t4-7.m4a","roles":["M","S","S","S","S","S","V","V","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":7.05,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-26-apps-creator-takes-down-popular/ja/t4-7.m4a","durJa":8.04,"times":[0.0,0.72,1.14,1.64,1.74,2.06,2.44,2.72,2.98,3.36,3.78,4.14,4.5,4.86,5.22,5.98]}],"bands":{"core1000":64,"core1800":13,"ngsl":7,"tsl":7,"nawl":1,"beyond":8},"grammar":[{"i":1,"focus":", reaching top charts in early 2014","title":"Participle Clause for Result","note":"The present participle phrase introduces a simultaneous result or outcome. It smoothly modifies the preceding main clause."},{"i":6,"focus":"was officially withdrawn","title":"Passive Voice","note":"The passive structure places focus on the game itself rather than the person who took it down. The agent is omitted as it is implied by context."}]},"t5":{"sentences":[{"text":"Developed in just a few days by Vietnamese programmer Dong Nguyen, Flappy Bird debuted quietly in May 2013.","voice":"voice/2026-10-26-apps-creator-takes-down-popular/t5-0.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","S","S","V","M","M","M","M"],"dur":8.37,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-26-apps-creator-takes-down-popular/ja/t5-0.m4a","durJa":10.89,"times":[0.0,0.7,0.84,1.12,1.34,1.56,1.86,2.24,2.7,3.3,3.84,4.94,5.32,5.58,5.9,6.48,7.06,7.22]},{"text":"The minimalist mobile game tasked players with navigating a pixelated bird through narrow gaps between green obstacles.","voice":"voice/2026-10-26-apps-creator-takes-down-popular/t5-1.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","S","V","O","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":7.51,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-26-apps-creator-takes-down-popular/ja/t5-1.m4a","durJa":10.13,"times":[0.0,0.1,0.46,0.88,1.28,1.66,2.18,2.5,2.96,3.34,4.02,4.34,4.8,5.14,5.62,6.16,6.46]},{"text":"By early 2014, the title experienced an astonishing viral explosion, topping free download charts across multiple digital storefronts.","voice":"voice/2026-10-26-apps-creator-takes-down-popular/t5-2.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","S","S","V","O","O","O","O","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":9.56,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-26-apps-creator-takes-down-popular/ja/t5-2.m4a","durJa":10.73,"times":[0.0,0.12,0.34,1.64,1.84,2.08,2.74,3.12,3.72,4.24,5.84,6.06,6.38,6.72,7.12,7.6,8.04,8.6]},{"text":"At the height of its sudden popularity, the straightforward application was generating roughly $50,000 in daily advertising revenue for its creator.","voice":"voice/2026-10-26-apps-creator-takes-down-popular/t5-3.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","M","M","M","M","S","S","S","V","V","O","O","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":9.13,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-26-apps-creator-takes-down-popular/ja/t5-3.m4a","durJa":9.48,"times":[0.0,0.08,0.18,0.44,0.66,0.76,1.02,2.34,2.4,2.7,3.52,3.92,4.22,5.13,6.04,6.72,6.96,7.52,8.0,8.36,8.5]},{"text":"Players were captivated by its simple mechanics, yet many expressed frustration at the game's brutal level of difficulty.","voice":"voice/2026-10-26-apps-creator-takes-down-popular/t5-4.m4a","roles":["S","V","V","M","M","M","M","M","S","V","O","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":7.14,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-26-apps-creator-takes-down-popular/ja/t5-4.m4a","durJa":8.17,"times":[0.0,0.24,0.56,1.2,1.5,1.64,1.92,2.98,3.24,3.52,3.94,4.56,5.1,5.2,5.52,5.9,6.38,6.5]},{"text":"Uncomfortable with the intense public attention and troubled by the app's addictive design, Nguyen made an extraordinary executive decision.","voice":"voice/2026-10-26-apps-creator-takes-down-popular/t5-5.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","S","V","O","O","O","O"],"dur":8.3,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-26-apps-creator-takes-down-popular/ja/t5-5.m4a","durJa":9.13,"times":[0.0,0.52,0.84,0.98,1.34,1.78,2.14,2.8,3.14,3.48,3.62,3.9,4.22,5.32,5.52,5.98,6.22,6.74,7.52]},{"text":"On February 10, 2014, he voluntarily pulled Flappy Bird from both Apple's App Store and the Google Play marketplace.","voice":"voice/2026-10-26-apps-creator-takes-down-popular/t5-6.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","M","S","M","V","O","O","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":7.7,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-26-apps-creator-takes-down-popular/ja/t5-6.m4a","durJa":10.24,"times":[0.0,0.08,0.28,1.14,2.26,2.44,3.12,3.58,4.06,4.32,4.62,4.8,5.3,5.46,5.72,6.22,6.38,6.54,6.88]},{"text":"The unexpected withdrawal triggered a frenzy, causing pre-loaded smartphones to command exorbitant prices on online auction sites.","voice":"voice/202